![Photo by Hamed Taha on Unsplash](cover.jpg)

This is a simple <https://chaucha.cl> wallet generator
for usage within Github actions.

## Example workflow

```yaml
name: Integration Test
on: [push]
jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@master
      - name: Self test
        id: selftest

        # Put your action repo here
        uses: proyecto-chaucha/chaucha-gha-wallet-generator@master
        with:
          value: "test"

      - name: Check outputs
        run: |
          test "${{ steps.selftest.outputs.privkey }}" == "8G63zuGKfQ7ho4X1ytHr75HmrZxJq3NFQ51YSPdyDh4hsHEr2Bg"
          test "${{ steps.selftest.outputs.pubkey }}" == "ch4uy1bAfLLf6RMcmkrHBa8oxtuMTgwXyS"
```

### Inputs

``` =html
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Input</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>value</code> <em>(optional)</em></td><td>String value to create a new wallet address. Empty value will generate a random address.</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

### Outputs

``` =html
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Output</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>privkey</code></td><td>Chaucha Wallet Private Key Address</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>pubkey</code></td><td>Chaucha Wallet Public Key Address</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

